  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Aspire for Her (AFH) Organizing IBM Certification Workshop on “What do we see when we hire? ”</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<h3><b>Women Cell, ATME College of Engineering</b><b>\n</b><b>in association with </b></h3>\n<h3><b>Aspire for Her (AFH) </b></h3>\n<h3><b>Organizing IBM Certification Workshop </b></h3>\n<h3><b>on </b></h3>\n<h3><b>“What do we see when we hire? ”</b></h3>\n&nbsp;\n\n<b>Resource Person:</b>\n\n<b>Manushree Singh </b>\n\nDiversity and Inclusion Leader,\n\nCapgemini, India\n\n<b>Soma Pandey</b>\n\nSenior HR Leader &amp; Strategic advisor\n\n<b>Objectives of the Webinar:</b>\n<ul>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">Learn with IBM</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">Bringing the best quality technical upskilling to the college</li>\n</ul>\n<b>Date: </b>9th October 2021\n\n<b>Time: 3</b>PM\n\n<b>Target participants</b>: Students of ATMECE\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
